  "name": "Cod and Prawn Pie with Saffron Potatoes",
  "subtitle": "A tomato-based seafood pie finished with saffron-scented potatoes.",
  "description": "Cod and prawns bake in a smoky pepper-and-tomato sauce beneath thin saffron potatoes, with a simple green vegetable side.",
